# What the core pack puts into a repository.
# Format:  <source, relative to this directory>|<target, relative to repo root>|<mode>
#
# managed   replaced by devkit-sync; hash recorded in devkit.lock.json
# block:ID  content injected into the target between the ID markers
# template  written only when the target does not exist
# dir       whole directory copied; every file tracked as managed

AGENTS.core.md|AGENTS.core.md|managed
.gitattributes|.gitattributes|managed
editorconfig.block|.editorconfig|block:devkit:core
gitignore.block|.gitignore|block:devkit:core
skills|.claude/skills|dir

templates/CLAUDE.md|CLAUDE.md|template
templates/AGENTS.md|AGENTS.md|template
templates/AGENTS.local.md|AGENTS.local.md|template
templates/CHANGELOG.md|CHANGELOG.md|template
templates/ROADMAP.md|ROADMAP.md|template
templates/docs/README.md|docs/README.md|template
templates/config.sh|.devkit/config.sh|template
